&lt;p&gt;
	Within our brewery we have two seperate operations ,being the brewery business, together with The Kitchen &amp;amp; Taproom business.The change in published rating arose from an inspection which took place by Liverpool City Council Environmental Health in September.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
	The inspection identified various concerns, which primarily related to the Brewery operation and resulted in that operation being temporarily closed, whilst those concerns were addressed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
	Liverpool City council did not request the closure of the Kitchen &amp;amp; taproom operation, but rather, they permitted it to remain open and trading.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
	The experienced leadership within the venue teams, ensures standards are held and maintained for the benefit of our customers&lt;/p&gt;
